er passenger; MCO → MSP: $499 per passenger.\n- You have 2 passengers.\n- As a Gold member, you get 4 free checked bags per business class passenger (total 8 free bags for 2 passengers), so adding 2 checked bags will be free of charge.\n\nCost calculation:\n- Original total paid: $498\n- New total for business class: (2 × $350) + (2 × $499) = $1,698\n- Additional cost to upgrade: $1,698 - $498 = $1,200\n\nWould you like to proceed with upgrading both flights to business class for all passengers and adding 2 checked bags under your name, with an additional cost of $1,200? Please confirm if you’d like to proceed and let me know which payment method you’d like to use (credit card or travel certificate).","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:12:23.930903","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":273,"prompt_tokens":4742}},{"content":"Thanks for breaking down the costs. Since the upgrade fee is higher than I’m comfortable with, could you check how much it would be to upgrade just one passenger—Noah—to business class on both flights, while keeping the other passenger in the original class? I’d still like to add the 2 checked bags under my name.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:12:24.980551","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":68,"prompt_tokens":921}},{"content":"All passengers in a reservation must fly in the same cabin class for all flights. It is not possible to upgrade only one passenger to business class while keeping the other in economy within the same reservation.\n\nWould you like to proceed with another option, such as upgrading both passengers or keeping your current booking? Let me know h